				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mnevidis regia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					36, 8, 14, § 65</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 1, 21</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Amm. 22, 14, 7</span></i>.</div>
